  "prototypeNotes": [
    "Rage is initialized from Auspice, Gnosis from Race, and Willpower from Tribe.",
    "Permanent and current values are persisted separately.",
    "Current equals permanent at creation only as a reversible prototype decision.",
    "Freebie costs are represented as Rage 1, Gnosis 2, and Willpower 1 per permanent point.",
    "Spending, restoration, frenzy, spirit mechanics, and automatic-success mechanics remain unavailable.",
    "Chronicle Core remains unaware of Rage, Gnosis, Willpower, and all Werewolf-specific resource behavior."
  ]
